WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,510 --> 00:00:12,190
He is not a brother

2
00:00:12,190 --> 00:00:13,630
I told you so much

3
00:00:13,630 --> 00:00:14,750
Give me an accurate answer

4
00:00:14,750 --> 00:00:15,670
OK or not

5
00:00:16,030 --> 00:00:17,950
I don't believe you are a great man

6
00:00:17,950 --> 00:00:19,590
If he really dares to be blind

7
00:00:20,350 --> 00:00:21,950
The performance should be tomorrow

8
00:00:24,010 --> 00:00:26,450
Tomorrow, if I tell you something different, brother

9
00:00:27,300 --> 00:00:33,740
Otherwise I would be happy, Brother Ling

10
00:00:34,020 --> 00:00:35,760
I was ignorant before

11
00:00:36,200 --> 00:00:44,380
From now on, I will listen to you, Geolingge, me.

12
00:00:44,500 --> 00:00:46,740
Who here is least likely to be a great man?

13
00:00:48,100 --> 00:00:50,340
Only Brother Ling

14
00:00:50,340 --> 00:00:52,260
And we have followed the path of great men
